    "name": "IPinfo (API Integration Scout)",
    "description": "IPinfo is a REST API for IP intelligence: geolocation, ASN, network flags (anonymous, hosting, anycast, mobile, satellite), and more. It has a free Lite tier and paid Core/Plus/Max tiers, plus a batch endpoint and downloadable databases.\n\nGenerated by API Integration Scout from https://ipinfo.io/developers on 2026-10-09T13:32:52.064Z.\nSet {{apiKey}} in the environment. Requests marked Inferred were not explicitly documented; check them before relying on them.\nAuthentication: Bearer token (Authorization header) (documented).\nOther documented auth methods: see the \"Auth alternatives\" folder.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
